    {
      "name": "Alchemist",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/consumables/potions/potion-flash-open-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Why respect knights when my potions can do anything that you can?</strong></p><p><em>—Justin Kuritzkes, Potion Seller</em></p><p>Often sequestered in a lab, alchemists study the essence of creation. They are as curious as they are resourceful, and always have “just the thing for this.”</p><h3>Iconic Alchemists</h3><ul><li><strong>The Colorman</strong>, <em>Sacré Bleu</em></li><li><strong>Dr. Jekyll</strong>, <em>Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde</em></li><li><strong>Tessa Cade</strong>, <em>Defy the Night</em></li><li><strong>Walter White</strong>, <em>Breaking Bad</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Alchemist</h3><p>The alchemist is a low-defense, high-damage-and-utility blaster. It’s recommended you stay Far from Enemies to use Alchemical Items.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Use (Craft &amp; Attack)<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Backline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Alchemist or Assassin<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Reason<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★★☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Arcana, Craft, Medicine</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><strong>Formulae</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Known</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Value</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Alchemy, Catalyze</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>50s</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Eureka (15+)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>1g</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>1g 50s</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Potency (+1)</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>2g</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>2g 50s</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Mix, Eureka (14+)</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>3g</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>3g 50s</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Potency (+2)</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>4g</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>4g 50s</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Prima Materia, Eureka (13+)</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>5g</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": false,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Alchemy",
            "description": "<p>Choose 4 Alchemical Items (p. 84) with a value no higher than (your Level × 50s). You only need 5s of Materials and Alchemy Tools equipped to Craft them.</p><p>You learn to Craft 1 other Alchemical Item this way every 3 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "formulaAmount": 4,
            "formulaValueCap": "@attributes.level.value * 50"
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Catalyze",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Deft Hands Perk (p. 68), and can Craft Alchemical Items with the Use Action.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [
              "Compendium.vagabond.perks.Item.vtNfeEdWNUWvaeRM"
            ],
            "perkAmount": 1
          },
          {
            "level": 2,
            "name": "Eureka (15+)",
            "description": "<p>When you pass a Craft Check by 15 or more, you gain a Studied die (p. 19). The roll required to do so is decreased by 1 every 4 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 1,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0
          },
          {
            "level": 3,
            "name": "Perk",
            "description": "<p>Choose a new Perk. You must meet the prerequisites to take it, unless the Perk is granted through a Class Feature.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 1
          },
          {
            "level": 4,
            "name": "Potency (+1)",
            "description": "<p>You have a +1 bonus to each of the damage and healing dice of your Alchemical Items, and they can Explode. This bonus increases by 1 every 4 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 1,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
